l approach this  task from a noble and altruistic  position like for example luffy but  others like zebek and blackbeard will  approach it just like typhon did they  will become monsters who are willing to  do anything to take down the new gods  this is a battle between heaven and  earth between olympus and the underworld  and while luffy may want to liberate  everyone from the oppression of the  world government blackbeard wants to  overthrow the oppressors so that he can  take their place so that he can become  the new king of the world the new divine  ruler and this is exactly what we can  expect in the final saga of the one  piece story the d-clan is the natural  enemy of the new gods because they are  the descendants of the old gods the  rulers of the ancient kingdom the  remaining members of the d clan will  attempt to overthrow the world  government but while some like luffy  will try to do it for noble ends others  like blackbeard will try to do it for  their own sinister purposes and the  final battle in the story will not only  be the world government and the new  generation of rebels trying to overthrow  them but we will also see a battle  between the different factions within  the rebels themselves between the two  faces of the d-clan the noble and  altruistic luffy and the dark and  vengeful blackbeard let me know what you  guys think has blackbeard been hiding  the fact that he is the son of roxty  zevic and has he been plotting revenge  for his father's death for 40 years also  is the final struggle between the world  government and the d clan inspired by  the greatest struggle in greek mythology  the epic clash between the titans and  the gods of olympus definitely share  your thoughts down in the comments below  if you're looking for a video to watch  next check out our video that explains  every single non-canon devil fruit in  one piece link in the description if you  enjoy our one piece content and want to  see more in the future leave a quick  l