how imprinted upon  blackbeard's body during the god valley  incident when teach would have been only  two years old but the reason why i bring  this up is the possible connection  between blackbeard his three-headed  jolly roger and the three-headed hound  of hades the mythical creature who  guards the entrance to the underworld  cerberus cerberus is a multi-headed  dog-like creature whose main purpose is  to prevent the dead from attempting to  leave the underworld he is usually  described as having three heads a  serpent's tail and many snakes  protruding all over his body although  the three-headed version is the most  common today in some versions of the  myth he has 50 or even 100 heads he is  also said to have multiple backs three  tongues inside his mouth and eyes that  flash with fire he is a chimera a  creature composed of many animal forms  that have grown together into one it  should go without saying that cerberus  has a very strange body much like  blackbeard his three heads correspond to  blackbeard's three skulls and he has  been said to symbolize the corpse  consuming earth the endless void that in  the end consumes everything in that  sense cerberus is certainly similar to  blackbeard whose yamiyami nomi is the  embodiment of an all-consuming void so  the parallels between blackbeard and  hades and his servant cerberus are clear  but what does this actually mean for the  one piece story even though oda clearly  takes a lot of inspiration from various  myths from all over the world he doesn't  adapt them word for word so how much can  these mythological parallels actually  tell us about what is going to happen  next in the one piece story and how one  piece will ultimately end  one very interesting fact about cerberus  could be tied directly to the mysterious  connection between blackbeard and rox d  zebek i'm sure that everyone has heard  of the theory that blackbeard might be  the secret son of zebec and that he was  orphaned during the god valley incident  when he was only 2 years old many have  speculated that blackbeard wants revenge  for the death of his father and for the  fact that he had to live his entire life  as an orphan him naming his ship the  saber of zebek is a blatant clue that  blackbeard intends to finish what zebek  started 40 years earlier he plans to  carry out zebec's master plan of  overthrowing the world government and  becoming the king of the world if we  accept that blackbeard was in part  inspired by hades and cerberus from  greek mythology then who would be the  inspiration for zebic a good place to  start is the father of cerberus typhon  who is a monster god and the father of  all the monsters he was a fire breeding  chimera even more terrifying than  cerberus himself  gaia and tartarus created typhon in  order to defeat zeus and the olympian  gods after they overthrew gaia's  children the titans typhon was able to  easily overpower all the olympian gods  except for zeus zeus fought typhon but  he lost the first battle and typhon tore  off his tendons in the process as an  injured zeus went into hiding on mount  olympus hermes was able to use his speed  to get zeus his tendons back eventually  zeus was able to defeat typhon by  hurling hundreds of lightning bolts at  him and then he placed an entire  mountain on top of him in order to stop  him from escaping this is extremely  interesting to me because in greek  mythology you have the ancient gods the  titans being overthrown by the new  olympian gods during the divine war  known as the titanomachi kind of like  the war between the ancient kingdom and  the alliance that became the world  government in one piece then you have  typhon coming in to try to overthrow the  olympian gods kind of like zebek  declared war on the world government and  tried to overthrow them but ultimately  failed however  typhon did leave a legacy behind he is  the father of all the monsters just like  the remnants of zevek's crew the rox  pirates all became monsters in their own  right and if blackbeard is partially  inspired by cerberus then just like  typhon is the father of cerberus zebek  may be the father of blackbeard and just  like zebek tried to overthrow the world  government and become the king of the  world blackbeard is trying to achieve  the same goal for blackbeard it's not  about fame or pirate riches it's not  even about becoming the pirate king it's  all about avenging zebic overthrowing  the new gods and becoming the king of  the world blackbeard will bring the  powers of the underworld darkness and  earthquakes and monsters into the realm  of the gods just like typhon did when he  fought the gods of olympus and with the  recent reveal about imusama's true power  i think that the comparison of eem and  the world government to zeus and the  olympian gods makes even more sense  perhaps the ancient kingdom represents  the titans who were overthrown by the  world government and the world  government represents the new olympian  gods i mean marijua and the domain of  the gods are pretty freaking similar to  mount olympus in greek mythology they  are both abodes of the gods high up in  the sky and separate from the rest of  the world below and it's even been  stated that the celestial dragons  usurped this land from a previous group  of creatures who were once considered to  be gods the lunarians which is very  similar to the olympian gods usurping  the position of the older gods the  titans so what if the secret of the d  clan is that they are the direct  descendants of the old gods those who  ruled over the ancient kingdom before  they were overthrown by the new gods the  celestial dragons that is why the  members of the d-clan are the natural  enemies of the gods the natural enemies  of the celestial dragons and what if the  remaining members of the d-clan are  destined to try and overthrow the  celestial dragons just like typhon tried  to overthrow the olympian gods some  members of the d-clan will approach this  task from a noble and altruistic  position like for example luffy but  others like zebek and blackbeard will  approach it just like typhon did they  will become monsters who are willing to  do anything to take down the new gods  this is a battle between heaven and  earth between olympus and the underworld  and while luffy may want to liberate  everyone from the oppression of the  world government blackbeard wants to  overthrow the oppressors so that he can  take their place so that he can become  the new king of the world the new divine  ruler and this is exactly what we can  expect in the final saga of the one  piece story the d-clan is the natural  enemy of the new gods because they are  the descendants of the old gods the  rulers of the ancient kingdom the  remaining members of the d clan will  attempt to overthrow the world  government but while some like luffy  will try to do it for noble ends others  like blackbeard will try to do it for  their own sinister purposes and the  final battle in the story will not only  be the world government and the new  generation of rebels trying to overthrow  them but we will also see a battle  between the different factions within  the rebels themselves between the two  faces of the d-clan the noble and  altruistic luffy and the dark and  vengeful blackbeard let me know what you  guys think has blackbeard been hiding  the fact that he is the son of roxty  zevic and has he been plotting revenge  for his father's death for 40 years also  is the final struggle between the world  government and the d clan inspired by  the greatest struggle in greek mythology  the epic clash between the titans and  the gods of olympus definitely share  your thoughts down in the comments below  if you're looking for a video to watch  next check out our video that explains  every single non-canon devil fruit in  one piece link in the description if you  enjoy our one piece content and want to  see more in the future leave a quick  like and comment it only takes a second  but it helps us out a lot and if you  haven't taken the time to subscribe yet  do me a favor and make this the video  that you subscribe and hit that  notification bell to turn on all  notifications subscribing and hitting  the notification bell may seem like a  little thing but it actually helps out a  lot on youtube you can also hit me up on  twitter and instagram at animeopror  thanks again to tower of fantasy for  sponsoring this video check them out  link in the description as always thank  you guys so much for watching and until  next time see ya space cowboys
 

